{"id": "I001", "record_type": "interpretation", "layer": "inference", "subject_id": "sakiko", "statement_zh": "对舞台世界观的严格维护，可理解为她在失去旧有生活后重新建立秩序的方式之一。", "evidence_ids": ["E01", "E14", "E24"], "basis_record_ids": ["F022", "F025", "F026"], "rationale": "把失去旧家与乐队的背景，与她投入构建舞台秩序的行为联系起来。", "alternative_reading": "也可以主要从职业舞台制作与商业经营目标理解。", "strength": "moderate", "evidence_status": "curator_reasoning", "valid_time": {"phase": "ave_mujica_early", "calendar_date": null, "precision": "relative_phase"}}
{"id": "I002", "record_type": "interpretation", "layer": "inference", "subject_id": "sakiko", "statement_zh": "祥子与喵梦的早期冲突，可从舞台控制权与公开传播策略的分歧来理解。", "evidence_ids": ["E07", "E08", "E20"], "basis_record_ids": ["F029", "F030", "R011"], "rationale": "方向分歧与摘面具事件相连，监督也强调喵梦能够当面反驳祥子。", "alternative_reading": "具体场景也涉及各人的职业野心和私人处境。", "strength": "moderate", "evidence_status": "curator_reasoning", "valid_time": {"phase": "ave_ep02_context", "calendar_date": null, "precision": "relative_phase"}}
{"id": "I003", "record_type": "interpretation", "layer": "inference", "subject_id": "sakiko", "statement_zh": "第3话临场应对显示祥子具备在演出压力下处理突发状况的能力。", "evidence_ids": ["E09"], "basis_record_ids": ["F031", "R008"], "rationale": "从已发生的一次成功应对归纳能力表现。", "alternative_reading": "这也可能是对特定舞台和搭档熟悉所形成的局部能力。", "strength": "limited", "evidence_status": "curator_reasoning", "valid_time": {"phase": "ave_ep03_context", "calendar_date": null, "precision": "relative_phase"}}
{"id": "I004", "record_type": "interpretation", "layer": "inference", "subject_id": "sakiko", "statement_zh": "由访谈记述的父女与祖孙关系，可推出初华/初音处在祥子的叔姨辈。", "evidence_ids": ["E32", "E28"], "basis_record_ids": ["F047", "F048", "R025", "R026"], "rationale": "同一丰川定治分别被称为初华的父亲与祥子的祖父，按一般家系推导为长一辈亲属。", "alternative_reading": "母系/父系分支、同父异母与具体称谓需结合第11话原片；本条保留为基于一手复述的关系推导。", "strength": "strong", "evidence_status": "curator_reasoning", "valid_time": {"phase": "family_backstory", "calendar_date": null, "precision": "relative_phase"}, "object_id": "uika", "predicate": "aunt_generation_relative", "direction": "directed", "relation_kind": "kinship_inference"}
